issue_context.body:
A cluster using CCR to follow a data stream from another cluster can cause the autoscaling capacity API to fail to deliver an autoscaling response with an exception like:

```
GET /_autoscaling/capacity/
{
  "error": {
    "root_cause": [
      {
        "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
        "reason": "data stream [data-stream-name] cannot be rolled over, because it is a replicated data stream"
      }
    ],
    "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
    "reason": "data stream [data-stream-name] cannot be rolled over, because it is a replicated data stream"
  },
  "status": 400
}
```
